    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[siege of Rome (Wikipedia — did you know?)]]></title>
        <id>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siege_of_Rome_(537%E2%80%93538)</id>
        <link href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siege_of_Rome_(537%E2%80%93538)"/>
        <updated>2026-10-19T11:05:08.128Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[... that, during the <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siege_of_Rome_(537–538)" title="Siege of Rome (537–538)">siege of Rome</a></b>, the Goths told the citizens of Rome that its Byzantine defenders had previously visited Italy only as actors and thieving sailors?]]></content>
    </entry>
    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Octavian Cotescu (Wikipedia — did you know?)]]></title>
        <id>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octavian_Cotescu</id>
        <link href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octavian_Cotescu"/>
        <updated>2026-10-19T11:05:08.129Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[... that actor <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Octavian_Cotescu" title="Octavian Cotescu">Octavian Cotescu</a></b> was serving in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_National_Assembly_(Romania)" title="Great National Assembly (Romania)">Romanian communist legislature</a> when he appeared in a production of <i><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Master_and_Margarita" title="The Master and Margarita">Master and Margarita</a></i>, alongside his topless wife?]]></content>
    </entry>
    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Favre-Leuba (Wikipedia — did you know?)]]></title>
        <id>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Favre-Leuba</id>
        <link href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Favre-Leuba"/>
        <updated>2026-10-19T11:05:08.130Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[... that the first woman to climb Mount Everest wore a <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Favre-Leuba" title="Favre-Leuba">Favre-Leuba</a></b> watch while doing so?]]></content>
