    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Mykhailo Volynets (Wikipedia — did you know?)]]></title>
        <id>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mykhailo_Volynets</id>
        <link href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mykhailo_Volynets"/>
        <updated>2026-10-19T11:05:08.132Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[... that Ukrainian trade unionist <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mykhailo_Volynets" title="Mykhailo Volynets">Mykhailo Volynets</a></b> was inspired to organise miners after supporting the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1984–1985_United_Kingdom_miners'_strike" title="1984–1985 United Kingdom miners' strike">1984–1985 United Kingdom miners' strike</a>?]]></content>
    </entry>
    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Stenaelurillus darwini (Wikipedia — did you know?)]]></title>
        <id>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stenaelurillus_darwini</id>
        <link href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stenaelurillus_darwini"/>
        <updated>2026-10-19T11:05:08.134Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[... that unlike most female spiders in their genus, <i><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stenaelurillus_darwini" title="Stenaelurillus darwini">Stenaelurillus darwini</a></b></i> have domed "flaps" covering the opening to their reproductive organs?]]></content>
