        <updated>2026-10-19T11:05:08.139Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[... that <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mindaugas" title="Mindaugas">Mindaugas</a> bribed <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andreas_von_Velven" title="Andreas von Velven">Andreas von Velven</a></b> with gifts and agreed to be baptized to stop the Livonian Order's invasion of Lithuania?]]></content>
